  "observations": [
    "All six registration keyboard form images show complete submit focus outlines; all six registration error images show the whole alert. At 150% later buttons require vertical scrolling.",
    "Registration registered and restored/restarted base images show the upper settings viewport rather than the registered row; actual persisted registration is checked by the native assertions.",
    "The six explicitly named overview theme/zoom matrices show whole read-error alerts and complete keyboard disclosure focus outlines. Early overview filenames ending light inherit the preceding dark theme.",
    "The overview page-two base image shows the repository heading; pagination controls are below the viewport. Native query receipts verify the 20/1/20 query scope.",
    "Worktree settings show picker/save busy states and retained input, selected paths, save failures, actual creation and restored settings. All six settings theme/zoom images show the complete save-error alert.",
    "Long path inputs display only their visible segment. At 150% subsequent page controls and the ninth settings category require vertical scrolling. No complete reference or current installer acceptance is inferred."
  ],
  "scope": "Visual acceptance of the three affected worktree surfaces in this complete source run only. All 132 selected current-run originals are retained, but the other 75 are not claimed as reviewed by this record. Current distribution, creation ownership/snapshot cleanup and complete reference parity require separate acceptance."
